  (424, 5, 20, 'Exact Rational & Arbitrary-Precision BigInt Calculator', 'Performs exact fractional and 256-bit integer math at the edge without JavaScript float rounding errors.', 'Forensic Accounting, Ledger & Mathematical Invariant Engines', 'catalog', 'Supplied Batch 5 attachment', 'tabor-sov-020-rational'),
